{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01151","headline":"相和歌辞 雀台怨 · 程氏长文","name":"相和歌辞 雀台怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君王去後行人绝，萧竽不响歌喉咽。\n雄劒无威光彩沈，宝琴零落金星灭。\n玉阶寂寂坠秋露，月照当时歌舞处。\n当时歌舞人不回，化爲今日西陵灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"程氏长文","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}